IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `sg-core`
IMPORT `sga2-nouns`

-- Companies Act 1967 (Singapore), 2020 Revised Edition: s 76(1), (1A), (2), (3), (4), (16) and (17) -- the prohibition on a company
-- financing dealings in its own shares or the shares of its holding company, what counts as financial assistance, and when s 76 does not apply.
-- Layer 1: the law as the text states it. Each condition of the prohibition is its own function; s 76(1) composes them.
--
-- WHAT THE ANSWERS MEAN (rule of 2026-10-29, assumed, not ruled).
--   JUST TRUE   the text says yes.
--   JUST FALSE  the text says no in its own words (a flat negative, "except", "unless", "means"), or an element of the provision's own question is unmet.
--   NOTHING     the text does not say: a scope limit with no "only", a list not closed, "includes", a deeming that adds to the ordinary meaning.
-- A caller must never turn NOTHING into FALSE.
--
-- INPUTS taken from elsewhere (seams): whether the holding company or ultimate holding company is a public company (a defined term of s 4(1),
-- asked as a fact about each body); whether an exception expressly provided by the Act applies (computed by sga2-s76-exceptions,
-- sga2-s76-whitewash and sga2-s76-special-resolution, or by ss 76B to 76G of another part).

§ `Section 76(1): the prohibition`

-- The companies the subsection binds: a public company, or a company whose holding company or ultimate holding company is a public company.
-- src:7323 | 76.—(1) Except as otherwise expressly provided by this Act, a
-- src:7324 | public company or a company whose holding company or ultimate
-- src:7325 | holding company is a public company must not, whether directly or
-- src:7326 | indirectly, give any financial assistance for the purpose of, or in
-- src:7327 | connection with —
@ref s 76(1) (src:7323-7327)
GIVEN `the company is a public company` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the holding company of the company is a public company` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the ultimate holding company of the company is a public company` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 76(1) the company is one the subsection binds` MEANS
    IF    `the company is a public company`
       OR `the holding company of the company is a public company`
       OR `the ultimate holding company of the company is a public company`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "a public company or a company whose holding company or ultimate holding company is a public company must not" -- a scope limit with no "only" (periods ruling of 2026-11-05, item (c)); the subsection says nothing of any other company

-- Limb (a): the acquisition, whether before or at the same time as the giving of the assistance, of shares or units of shares in the company,
-- or in a holding company or ultimate holding company of the company.
-- src:7329 | (a) the acquisition by any person, whether before or at the
-- src:7330 | same time as the giving of financial assistance, of —
-- src:7332 | (i) shares or units of shares in the company; or
-- src:7334 | (ii) shares or units of shares in a holding company or
-- src:7335 | ultimate holding company (as the case may be) of the
-- src:7336 | company; or
@ref s 76(1)(a) (src:7329-7336)
GIVEN `the acquisition took place before or at the same time as the giving of the financial assistance` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the shares or units of shares are shares or units of shares in the company` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the shares or units of shares are shares or units of shares in a holding company or ultimate holding company of the company` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 76(1)(a) the acquisition is one that paragraph (a) names` MEANS
    IF    `the acquisition took place before or at the same time as the giving of the financial assistance`
      AND (    `the shares or units of shares are shares or units of shares in the company`
            OR `the shares or units of shares are shares or units of shares in a holding company or ultimate holding company of the company`)
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "(a) the acquisition by any person, whether before or at the same time as the giving of financial assistance, of -- (i) shares or units of shares in the company; or (ii) shares or units of shares in a holding company or ultimate holding company" -- an element of the limb is unmet (split site (i), fork line F-A1)

-- Limb (b): the proposed acquisition by any person of shares or units of shares in the company, or in a holding company or ultimate holding company.
-- src:7338 | (b) the proposed acquisition by any person of —
-- src:7340 | (i) shares or units of shares in the company; or
-- src:7345 | (ii) shares or units of shares in a holding company or
-- src:7346 | ultimate holding company (as the case may be) of the
-- src:7347 | company.
@ref s 76(1)(b) (src:7338-7347)
GIVEN `the acquisition was proposed when the financial assistance was given` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the shares or units of shares are shares or units of shares in the company` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the shares or units of shares are shares or units of shares in a holding company or ultimate holding company of the company` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 76(1)(b) the proposed acquisition is one that paragraph (b) names` MEANS
    IF    `the acquisition was proposed when the financial assistance was given`
      AND (    `the shares or units of shares are shares or units of shares in the company`
            OR `the shares or units of shares are shares or units of shares in a holding company or ultimate holding company of the company`)
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "(b) the proposed acquisition by any person of -- (i) shares or units of shares in the company; or (ii) shares or units of shares in a holding company or ultimate holding company" -- an element of the limb is unmet (split site (i), fork line F-A1)

-- The prohibition itself: the company must not, directly or indirectly, give any financial assistance for the purpose of, or in connection with,
-- an acquisition (limb (a)) or proposed acquisition (limb (b)). "Except as otherwise expressly provided by this Act" and s 76(17) take it away.
-- The purpose or connection may be one the company is taken to have by s 76(3) or (4): the caller states that as one fact.
-- src:7323 | 76.—(1) Except as otherwise expressly provided by this Act, a
-- src:7324 | public company or a company whose holding company or ultimate
-- src:7325 | holding company is a public company must not, whether directly or
-- src:7326 | indirectly, give any financial assistance for the purpose of, or in
-- src:7327 | connection with —
-- src:7329 | (a) the acquisition by any person, whether before or at the
-- src:7330 | same time as the giving of financial assistance, of —
-- src:7332 | (i) shares or units of shares in the company; or
-- src:7334 | (ii) shares or units of shares in a holding company or
-- src:7335 | ultimate holding company (as the case may be) of the
-- src:7336 | company; or
-- src:7338 | (b) the proposed acquisition by any person of —
-- src:7340 | (i) shares or units of shares in the company; or
-- src:7345 | (ii) shares or units of shares in a holding company or
-- src:7346 | ultimate holding company (as the case may be) of the
-- src:7347 | company.
@ref s 76(1) (src:7323-7347)
GIVEN `the company is a public company` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the holding company of the company is a public company` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the ultimate holding company of the company is a public company` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the company gives, or has given, financial assistance, directly or indirectly` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the assistance is for the purpose of the acquisition` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the assistance is in connection with the acquisition` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the company is taken by subsection (3) or (4) to have given the assistance for the purpose of, or in connection with, the acquisition` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the acquisition took place before or at the same time as the giving of the financial assistance` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the acquisition was proposed when the financial assistance was given` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the shares or units of shares are shares or units of shares in the company` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the shares or units of shares are shares or units of shares in a holding company or ultimate holding company of the company` IS A BOOLEAN
      `an exception expressly provided by this Act applies` IS A BOOLEAN
      `section 76 does not apply to the act under subsection (17)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 76(1) subsection (1) bars the company from giving the financial assistance` MEANS
    IF `s 76(1) the company is one the subsection binds` `the company is a public company` `the holding company of the company is a public company` `the ultimate holding company of the company is a public company` EQUALS NOTHING
    THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the subsection binds "a public company or a company whose holding company or ultimate holding company is a public company" and says nothing of any other company (periods ruling of 2026-11-05, item (c))
    ELSE (IF `an exception expressly provided by this Act applies` OR `section 76 does not apply to the act under subsection (17)`
          THEN JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Except as otherwise expressly provided by this Act" (and s 76(17): "This section does not apply in relation to the doing of any act or thing pursuant to a contract entered into before 15 May 1987")
          ELSE (IF     `the company gives, or has given, financial assistance, directly or indirectly`
                   AND (    `the assistance is for the purpose of the acquisition`
                         OR `the assistance is in connection with the acquisition`
                         OR `the company is taken by subsection (3) or (4) to have given the assistance for the purpose of, or in connection with, the acquisition`)
                   AND (    (`s 76(1)(a) the acquisition is one that paragraph (a) names` `the acquisition took place before or at the same time as the giving of the financial assistance` `the shares or units of shares are shares or units of shares in the company` `the shares or units of shares are shares or units of shares in a holding company or ultimate holding company of the company` EQUALS JUST TRUE)
                         OR (`s 76(1)(b) the proposed acquisition is one that paragraph (b) names` `the acquisition was proposed when the financial assistance was given` `the shares or units of shares are shares or units of shares in the company` `the shares or units of shares are shares or units of shares in a holding company or ultimate holding company of the company` EQUALS JUST TRUE))
                THEN JUST TRUE
                ELSE JUST FALSE))   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "must not, whether directly or indirectly, give any financial assistance for the purpose of, or in connection with -- (a) the acquisition ... or (b) the proposed acquisition" -- an element of the prohibition is unmet; the provision's own question (split site (i), fork line F-A1)

-- The same prohibition as a rule on the company: it must not give the assistance. No time limit and no consequence are stated in the subsection itself
-- (the offence is s 76(5), a consequence for the officers), so a standing prohibition: only the forbidden act reaches BREACH.
-- src:7323 | 76.—(1) Except as otherwise expressly provided by this Act, a
-- src:7324 | public company or a company whose holding company or ultimate
-- src:7325 | holding company is a public company must not, whether directly or
-- src:7326 | indirectly, give any financial assistance for the purpose of, or in
-- src:7327 | connection with —
@ref s 76(1) (src:7323-7327)
GIVEN `the name of the company` IS A STRING
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `s 76 act`
`s 76(1) a company the subsection binds must not give the financial assistance` MEANS
    PARTY Company `the name of the company`
    SHANT `s 76(1) give financial assistance for the purpose of, or in connection with, the acquisition or proposed acquisition of shares or units of shares`
    HENCE FULFILLED
    LEST BREACH BY Company `the name of the company` BECAUSE "the company gave financial assistance for the purpose of, or in connection with, an acquisition or proposed acquisition of shares or units of shares in itself or in its holding company or ultimate holding company"

§ `Section 76(1A): the company must not acquire its own shares or lend on the security of them`

-- (1A): a company (any company) must not, directly or indirectly, in any way, (a)(i) acquire shares or units of shares in the company; (a)(ii) purport to acquire
-- shares or units of shares in a holding company or ultimate holding company; (b)(i)/(ii) lend money on the security of such shares.
-- src:7351 | (1A) Except as otherwise expressly provided by this Act, a
-- src:7352 | company must not —
-- src:7354 | (a) whether directly or indirectly, in any way —
-- src:7356 | (i) acquire shares or units of shares in the company; or
-- src:7358 | (ii) purport to acquire shares or units of shares in a
-- src:7359 | holding company or ultimate holding company, as
-- src:7360 | the case may be, of the company; or
-- src:7362 | (b) whether directly or indirectly, in any way, lend money on
-- src:7363 | the security of —
-- src:7365 | (i) shares or units of shares in the company; or
-- src:7367 | (ii) shares or units of shares in a holding company or
-- src:7368 | ultimate holding company, as the case may be, of the
-- src:7369 | company.
@ref s 76(1A) (src:7351-7369)
GIVEN `what the company did` IS A `s 76 act`
      `an exception expressly provided by this Act applies` IS A BOOLEAN
      `section 76 does not apply to the act under subsection (17)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 76(1A) subsection (1A) bars the company from the act` MEANS
    IF `an exception expressly provided by this Act applies` OR `section 76 does not apply to the act under subsection (17)`
    THEN JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Except as otherwise expressly provided by this Act" (and s 76(17): "This section does not apply in relation to the doing of any act or thing pursuant to a contract entered into before 15 May 1987")
    ELSE CONSIDER `what the company did`
         WHEN `s 76(1A)(a)(i) acquire shares or units of shares in the company` THEN JUST TRUE
         WHEN `s 76(1A)(a)(ii) purport to acquire shares or units of shares in a holding company or ultimate holding company of the company` THEN JUST TRUE
         WHEN `s 76(1A)(b)(i) lend money on the security of shares or units of shares in the company` THEN JUST TRUE
         WHEN `s 76(1A)(b)(ii) lend money on the security of shares or units of shares in a holding company or ultimate holding company of the company` THEN JUST TRUE
         OTHERWISE JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "a company must not -- (a) ... acquire shares or units of shares in the company; or ... purport to acquire shares ... in a holding company ...; or (b) ... lend money on the security of" -- the act is none of those the subsection names; the provision's own question (split site (i), fork line F-A2)

